message.content:
Wallcoverings of plastic: HTSUS 3918.10 covers floor coverings and wall or ceiling coverings of plastics, with 3918.10.10 for those of vinyl chloride polymers. Vinyl wallcoverings on paper backing are classified in 3918.10.1000. The 10-digit statistical suffix is 3918.10.1000 (the 8-digit is 3918.10.10, with 00 appended).

Note that heading 4814 (wallpaper) excludes plastic-covered wallcoverings in rolls where the plastic layer is grained, embossed, colored, etc. Note 9 to chapter 48 limits 4814 to paper-based products, and Note 10 to chapter 48 excludes paper coated with plastics where the plastic exceeds half the thickness. Textured vinyl on paper backing therefore falls in 3918.

{"hts_code": "3918.10.1000", "reason": "Textured vinyl (polyvinyl chloride) sheet on paper backing in rolls is a plastic wall covering of heading 3918, subheading 3918.10.10 for vinyl chloride polymers, rather than wallpaper of heading 4814."}
